{
 "type": "doc",
 "version": 1,
 "content": [
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "1. What happens now"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "When the Sales By Customer or Sales By Representative report is downloaded as a spreadsheet, the numbers inside it arrive dressed up as text. Money comes out as "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "$1,979.40",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "code"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": " with a dollar sign and a comma. Percentages come out as "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "100.0%",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "code"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": " with a percent sign. Dates come out as "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Jul 31 2026",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "code"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Because those cells are text and not numbers, a person who opens the file in Excel cannot add them up, sort them, or build a pivot table without cleaning every column first."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "2. What should happen instead"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Both written descriptions ask for plain numbers so the file can be re-used."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "bulletList",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Sales By Customer, requirement S14-R9: \"The Margin % cell is a plain number to one decimal with no percent sign (for example, 64.7)\"."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Sales By Customer, requirement S14-R10: \"Dates export as mm-dd-yyyy - for example, 05-14-2026 - matching the ShopView-wide CSV date format.\""
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Sales By Customer, requirement S14-R11: \"Currency values export as plain numbers with no dollar sign and no thousands separators.\""
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Sales By Representative, requirement S14-R17: \"numeric columns are emitted as plain numbers for re-pivoting - no currency symbol, thousands separators, or parentheses\"."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "3. How to see it"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "orderedList",
   "attrs": {
    "order": 1
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Sign in and open "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
